TI  - Are there advantages with U-Albumin/U-Creatinine ratios compared with U-Albumin in monitoring diabetes?
PY  - 2005
T2  - Scandinavian Journal of Clinical and Laboratory Investigation
VL  - 65
IS  - 6
SP  - 439
EP  - 446
